# Testing conventions

- Test behavior visible to the user, not implementation details.
- Prefer queries by role, label, and accessible name.
- Mock network boundaries in unit tests, not internal components.
- Use Vitest + Testing Library for component behavior.
- Use Playwright for critical browser flows, responsive navigation, and axe accessibility checks.
- A bug fix should include a regression test when practical.
